  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cnTVPyv.png\" alt=\"橫幅圖片\" width=\"510\" height=\"121\"></p>\n<p>每日老爸將老爸笑話帶入Minecraft世界。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>如果你正在尋找一系列搞笑、老套、雙關語、讓人翻白眼、俗氣又糟糕的笑話，那麼你來對地方了！這個模組會在你每次加入世界/伺服器時，顯示一則老爸笑話給你。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#800000\">(此模組僅限客戶端使用，若需伺服器版本請查看 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/daily-dad-server\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>每日老爸 - 伺服器版</strong></a>)</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>免責聲明：</strong></p>\n<p>老爸笑話由<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ficanhazdadjoke.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">icanhazdadjoke</a></strong>的API提供。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0KFppoR.png\" alt=\"Akliz合作夥伴\" width=\"320\" height=\"152\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fakliz.net%252fmrbysco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">需要伺服器？使用優惠碼「mrbysco」可享首月8折優惠</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>如有疑問歡迎加入我的Discord。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/maPeNBK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/611982123435556884/widget.png?style=banner2\" alt=\"Discord連結\" width=\"320\" height=\"76\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>&nbsp;<strong>想支持我們嗎？</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Mrbysco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CEpJohV.png\" alt=\"Patreon贊助\" width=\"152\" height=\"35\"></a>&nbsp; -Mrbysco</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
